oSdgP0OLI-0Q7kNvwFW0Jal&_nc_oc=Adp6odTW1_g47HfkLaqz8gpeQIN1t7NrdXDRtufJgyBVUITQqZpp9jDYtrpxf8equ20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2n1dd56pk_Gz2hBrhIVl14M-TpY-6yV5iw6EN7OqI9Q&oe=6AE89AB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ckFSH1Z5S9kQ7kNvwHIhzFa&_nc_oc=Adp65CdjN21PIbkfc3Gy2bH-lgndqK9itD-8Qh-AjTN_zFPmaAHcVE_5TJ3lrKfgPWw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJgSjr4d2YW6RyHZtUZn8UcRFVwhHcWdK5wVRJ42iYeQ&oe=6AE89C4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A02-nbBFxCAQ7kNvwHzpe98&_nc_oc=AdpiS8WW9edng0y8zhV8bmTQv3ph2bj7UpWOYlNym4hjXrTAdU-oiXW_aCcBbQK2128&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQbnUbASSwCo_Fi8Pw9kAP8P9Jv99BI9WSEEbSuEGS4Zw&oe=6AE8C1AF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tq8D_0aVXF8Q7kNvwHNLEFr&_nc_oc=Adqj1phsk4diiU04JXsjtOXIScIEFR6njpb1BO2SH8sbIZmpwXALFhK8_3QpCztR8yA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQfPgd5Jwzz0XF66oY3ejszq3cpylX8f8cjbthpqsO5zA&oe=6AE8AB03"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tLuD90UZ4nIQ7kNvwF5UbO2&_nc_oc=Adrg8xGR-PUNmiXK_n6H3HWrTdaUeQTuabn5zJiAays9SiZNeN40wR3ALBNrCcqLZ7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS9LPa7jlZpqxcA5XYUd_oUdzjQOmRze9ta4DtLCGcDrw&oe=6AE8A358"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HP9N2YjZamkQ7kNvwE9C5ze&_nc_oc=AdpR2Skj9oWJEe8Bl7sVvTJ9QlpP7ijhKxX-MkbIWDFMxGJlRbc8OlnRadIjz6zrkCc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRovvKdIz1_P8S8o2WKdX3EdkpbEyyPfYfRnw0d_2F4pA&oe=6AE8B67C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080